        rdfs:label "ray-finned fishes: Characiformes radiation (Burns & Sidlauskas 2019 Evolution: 1,625 specimens, 128 species on trees_final.nexus; 24-LM body shape): Thompson-7 captures 55.5% of interspecific variance (PCA-7 92.3%), 3/4 pre-registered hypotheses supported (Brier 0.151)" ;
